        "Content": "<ul><li> A-Rated Energy Efficiency</li><li> Total Floor Space 213 m2 / 2300 sq ft</li><li> All town centre and local amenities at your doorstep</li><li> Rare opportunity on the Ennis market</li><li> Air To Water Underfloor Heating</li><li> Choice of Finishes Throughout</li><li> New Build Home completion for early 2027</li><li> Private Elevated site circa 0.994 acre</li><li> Cul De Sac Roadway</ul>"
